LineageOS Bass x86
===========

Getting started
---------------

LineageOS 24.0 (Android 17) with the x86 hardware layer used by Bass:Lineout.

To initialize your local repository, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u ssh://git@github.com/BlissBass-Private/lineage_bass_android.git -b lineage-24.0 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```

Bass-Core: the public x86 layer. The x86 additions live in `android-x86/`.
Lineage/AOSP projects that carry x86 changes; it is enabled in `default.xml`
once their lineage-24.0 branches exist on BlissBass-Private.

Bass Commercial (vendor/ax86-lite, its addons and private prebuilts) adds its
repos through local manifests from that vendor tree, never through this one.
